+  unchanged), `assert_momentum_window_matches_momentum` (row counts — unchanged), the range tests
+  in `shared.yml` and `domestic_league.yml`, the export's board keys (no column change).
+  what stops being enforced if it is wrong: nothing that is enforced today; what starts: the two
+  guards, on every MR data build and every nightly.
+  failure behaviour: a guard red is `error` (a wrong number would be shown — §3.3), stops the
+  dependents like any singular test, and leaves its rows in the audit dataset (`store_failures`,
