+  prefix, in the MR datasets in CI and beside the prod datasets nightly).
+  deploy_order: the models rebuild in `data:build:mr` into the MR datasets with `--defer`; on
+  merge the nightly rebuilds prod; no full-refresh needed (no incremental model touched).
+  blast_radius: no RAW table; no host; the nightly's runtime grows by two queries over the
+  intermediate tables (seconds). Cost: one `data:build:mr` per push, as for any model change.
